  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Siticone UI Controls - Key Improvements\n\nImportant Note, Please Read:\n# Before updating, securely back up your existing projects\n# Read the changelog below, carefully, before updating your library version.\n# If you have questions, contact us before you update your library.\n# If you want to test, do this on a new test project.\n\nCHANGELOG:\n1. SiticoneDataGridView\nAdded more control over tooltips and drag ghost visuals, including the ability to enable, disable, and customize tooltip content.\n\n2. SiticoneButton\nImproved click feedback with smoother ripple effects and better responsiveness when many buttons are used on one form.\n\n3. SiticoneLabel\nImproved text clarity, alignment, wrapping, ellipsis, image support, and right-to-left text behavior.\n\n4. SiticoneShimmerLabel\nImproved shimmer animation so it pauses, resumes, and stops more intelligently when not visible or not needed.\n\n5. SiticonePanel\nImproved rounded corners, borders, gradients, patterns, ripple effects, and overall visual rendering quality.\n\n6. SiticoneAdvancedPanel\nImproved advanced visual features including shadows, gradients, borders, animations, and background image rendering.\n\n7. SiticoneButtonTextbox\nImproved button interaction, icon transitions, placeholder display, validation feedback, and overall input experience.\n\n8. SiticoneTextButtonAdvanced\nImproved hover, press, ripple, icon, text, and underline behavior for smoother text-button interaction.\n\n9. SiticoneTextBoxAdvanced\nImproved focus, hover, placeholder behavior, image transitions, validation feedback, and border rendering.\n\n10. SiticoneCheckBox\nImproved checked, unchecked, indeterminate, ripple, keyboard, and text display behavior.\n\nAll updated controls\nAll updated controls remain backward compatible with existing projects.",
